Third-Party Software Notices and Information

================================================================================
Static landing-page assets
================================================================================

The GitHub Pages landing site bundles these third-party assets:

- **Star Nest fragment shader** - `src/components/StarNest.astro` embeds the
  GLSL "Star Nest" 3D-kaliset shader by Pablo Roman Andrioli. Original at
  https://www.shadertoy.com/view/XlfGRj, released under the MIT License.

- **Flying Toasters animation recipe** - `src/components/FlyingToasters.astro`
  adapts the CSS keyframe plus step()-flicker technique from Bryan Braun's
  `bryanbraun/after-dark-css` project
  (https://github.com/bryanbraun/after-dark-css), MIT-licensed for the
  HTML/CSS portion.

- **After Dark sprite GIFs** - `public/sprites/toaster-sprite.gif` and
  `public/sprites/toast.gif` originate from After Dark (1989), copyright
  Berkeley Systems, Inc. Re-distributed here for nostalgic homage; copyright
  remains with the original rightsholder.